// terrain.ron - Built-in terrain definitions for Antares RPG
//
// This file contains the twelve built-in terrain definitions in RON (Rusty
// Object Notation) format. IDs 13000–13011 are reserved for built-in terrain.
// Campaign-defined custom terrain should start at 13100 by convention.
//
// TerrainMeshStyle variants: Flat, Water, Mountain
// TerrainVegetation variants: None, GrassCover, Forest
//
// blocked: true prevents party movement onto that tile by default.
// height:  visual height offset for mesh rendering (0.0 = ground level).
// color:   RGB triple in [0.0, 1.0] range used as a tint / minimap color.

[
    // ── Ground (13000) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
